    cml:operator "Temporal Interval" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Defines temporal interval for telephone application" ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) If the person making an application for a warrant on an agency’s behalf:  (a) is the chief officer of the agency or a person in relation to whom an authorisation by the chief officer is in force under subsection (3); and  (b) thinks it necessary, because of urgent circumstances, to make the application by telephone;" ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

