    cml:premiseText "(4) Where, in accordance with subsection (3), a court of summary jurisdiction convicts a person of an offence against subsection 7(1) or section 63, the penalty that the court may impose is imprisonment for a period not exceeding 6 months." ;
    cml:conclusionText "Imprisonment for a period not exceeding 6 months is prohibited." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
